  "prefLabel": "Agr 1105.03 Commercial Values to be Applied",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Agr 1105.03 Commercial Values to be Applied. For the purpose of determining the commercial values to be applied under the provisions of RSA 431:8 and RSA 431:9, the values per unit of nitrogen, phosphate, and potash in commercial fertilizer shall be as follows:\n\n(a) Nitrogen, $12.00 per unit;\n\n(b) Phosphate, $19.00 per unit; and\n\n(c) Potash, $10.00 per unit.\n\nSource. #1769, eff 6-30-81; ss by #2408, eff 6-30-83; ss by #2889, eff 10-22-84, EXPIRED 10-22-90\n\nNew. #5436, eff 7-22-92, EXPIRED: 7-22-98\n\nNew. #7218, eff 3-29-00, EXPIRED: 3-29-08\n\nNew. #10464, eff 11-26-13 (from Agr 1105.02), EXPIRED: 11-26-23\n\nNew. #13947, eff 4-30-24, EXPIRED: 10-27-24\n\nNew. #14128, eff 11-26-24, EXPIRES: 11-26-34",
